        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Charlie Brown's Christmas Tales, A Charlie Brown Christmas\n- People: Lee Mendelson, Bill Melendez\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Topics: Broadcast scheduling, television specials\n\nFacts:\n- A Charlie Brown Christmas was produced by Lee Mendelson and directed by Bill Melendez.\n- A Charlie Brown Christmas debuted on CBS on December 9, 1965.\n- Charlie Brown's Christmas Tales has since been broadcast each Christmas season as a companion segment in an hour-long slot featuring an unedited version of A Charlie Brown Christmas.",
